<UL class="swap"></UL></DIV></DIV>
<DIV class="subNav1"><UL>
    <LI><a href="http://paper.xidian.edu.cn/" target="_blank" title="" onclick="_addDynClicks(&#34;wburl&#34;, 1271716923, 37210)">西电科大报</a></li>
    <LI><a href="https://www.toutiao.com/c/user/4124851253/#mid=4124851253" target="_blank" title="" onclick="_addDynClicks(&#34;wburl&#34;, 1271716923, 11106)">今日头条</a></li>
